## MovesApi

### List move meta ailments
## List move meta ailments
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/move-ailment/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json

### Get move meta ailment
## Get move meta ailment
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/move-ailment/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json

